==Battleground==
*3 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s (1,500%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 12~18 seconds<sup>360f~540f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Li'l Bun Bun]] (5%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns.
**1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns.
**10 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s (1,500%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Maawth]] spawns.
**4 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s (1,500%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**4 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s (1,500%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Calamary]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Make note of this stage's very low enemy limit, as enemies may not appear as expected. At the start, use [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] to defeat the 3 Li'l Bun Buns. When you trigger the boss fight, spam [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cats]] and Fishman Cats to get rid of the Li'l Bun Buns. Use [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to constantly damage the Bun Bun Symbiote and slow him (if Can Can has the Target [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] [[Talents|Talent]]) If not, use [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]], or any [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] to slow/freeze the Bun Bun. Once you get rid of the Bun Bun, Can Can, along with Fishman, should be able to defeat the Maawth and the I.M Phace easily. Calamary is not a threat.

==Trivia==
*Lord's Lecture's Japanese name, Emperor's Classroom (帝王の教室 ''Teiō no Kyōshitsu''), may be a reference to the television drama ''[[wikipedia:The Queen's Classroom|The Queen's Classroom]]'' (女王の教室 ''Joō no Kyōshitsu'').
*Since Lord's Lecture's Japanese name mentions a classroom, the "Lord" is most likely [[Bun Bun Symbiote]], a schoolteacher.

